{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:287cbb3a18c390644554f79bbe63bc19afa9c801648e8a6ded2cd304a10d8bd1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2d92dbd1059df7aaa6907c7a48cbdf25c97dc9f718ea4c4c4bd6f24cb5a4df8",
      "text": "下午茶时光的谈话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb313128ab7fcd65598a23e5afc0e2ab335b497dcd243f2199965e7db717a2f3",
      "text": "Cafe Parade不定期营业。\n受邀参加限定菜单试吃会的制作人，\n比预定时间稍早到达了店内。\n在准备妥当之前的空档，制作人一边喝红茶，\n一边听幸广讲述过去周游列国的故事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2d92dbd1059df7aaa6907c7a48cbdf25c97dc9f718ea4c4c4bd6f24cb5a4df8",
      "text": "下午茶时光的谈话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0085f10430894756426328bbf66ad34c6a94083903f9e3e4d374fb222ff16819",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n欢迎来到Cafe Parade的试吃会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c79d4aa62b47268e1fc8b5e7a58feddffaed6a2d84e7aadd852a8aebd29f2035",
      "text": "感谢您今天邀请我过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d622b14cc1822ee29814e26f119fde6af5590af7a3059109d80ba18c004825b",
      "text": "应该是我感谢你过来才对。这次配合下次营业推出的限定菜单，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e4c1a10d0aaf8abe7b3598541518850b266df53d4207e430071750587d8be85",
      "text": "能听取制作人的意见，\n大家都干劲十足呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a307d94107b0a37aaa306af48894b8b95b2bf2bf9e9b12dfcdfaae29bf6f2108",
      "text": "那么，虽然很想说立刻开始……\n不过阿斯兰和东云还在做菜呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef283139b01b4d8123041127d2f347a9ca760cf61464b096b043e3a96ff7d101",
      "text": "卷绪和咲好像也还要一会儿才能到。\n在准备好之前，能请你稍等一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e678361159fc70c59f377d207ebdcf2a4bb0d969552d9ed5c60b7b1ac722f93",
      "text": "当然可以。\n我也是比预定时间提前到了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06888071d1825acee321cf872ff248e0bc3508ad94074ae859b519e2276e1b40",
      "text": "谢谢。那么，在大家到齐之前，\n来杯红茶怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c11969057c8d50dcec395f080e59fb37ec0031e56e4f51be9b30aae274d76846",
      "text": "虽然也想端出法式小点心，\n不过接下来还有大餐等着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac61a3d2ff9d907a0bc00061b9b128d252a400c5919e8336c8aa1f0ce9310f5e",
      "text": "虽然算不上替代，\n聊聊我以前旅行过的国家怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac25abde1e09aad5dbfacec85930fc432b04ff871b0f399e7d31ae4822bb481d",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n请务必讲给我听！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7936699350a1fe107d875bbb14b4c68dbf47822c2cecb5c8dd96cd4981f555ea",
      "text": "让您久等了，这是无咖啡因红茶。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b6be1896b05eec3322fd39f4df6f7c3fbc9d5d60082cea75d296dcdcba5c3a",
      "text": "因为拜托过你空着肚子过来呢。\n所以选了对胃温和的无咖啡因茶。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89ed8a1180b68d32e80345cdc4a965b4cf5e2faf5c6010b629c0723c69525ba7",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。谢谢您。\n……香气真好，很好喝！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bed224fae64048af23e8f27d26b569c1158a9b622a292de1a70932cbbda2bc67",
      "text": "能合你的口味就再好不过了。\n那么，就来聊聊我环球旅行时的故事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b398c345d9c4e0cd4ab2add0a17504f7d7dc74ced7cdcf816cb8f1681d314fd3",
      "text": "这是我在欧洲旅行时的故事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ce319547d19de30866cd6473d426182ed66a329ebcc8aea5a72af150205a872",
      "text": "坐巴士移动的时候，\n我和邻座的旅行者熟络了起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e176ae85c60db8ae68acc90cbaaa552a593dcf607e0d3cfcc981263e1e125de5",
      "text": "聊着聊着，就聊到了至今去过的国家里风景美丽的地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f25c778b79945e282dc5ac3e9b7b2365f66a8dcfb36963a19e38118a3bab2c1b",
      "text": "那位旅行者顿时双眼放光，这么对我说道：",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33213a73ea65f7bb19188bd3f40dfdc1afb5a3c596bf229b19739ac19b647a69",
      "text": "“绝对得去一趟匈牙利的布达佩斯。\n美丽的景象正在那里等着你。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a234e6e794dde2a2edaba2cb6ae85d72dbd4d45ecf52e7db9821262a6aa26cc",
      "text": "“与其听我说千言万语，不如亲自去用双眼见证”，\n他是这么说的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc8c7f23328b6c343a8f0c8923badb1f09bd7c0b7cc2396108d89d459daecb4",
      "text": "听了那句话后，\n我便下定决心前往布达佩斯了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_c:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac09ea42c19ba9413d1c6e4bbb9eaf517ea25e9901ed675a5744edca572c6a00",
      "text": "不管走到哪里都深受男女老少喜爱，\n真是有幸广先生风格的展开呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d95cddb639406c68737c2d4619027a37bfc3a84899373fd6119e9ab4568d7da1",
      "text": "虽然在墨西哥也曾遇到过拦路打劫的就是了，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8e0b955126affd884a1d6caafed4b03134f057684f0e14dbedbbff93535f67f",
      "text": "但确实，遇上亲切的人和出色的人的机会\n可能会更多一些吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18091a04bf766d6563c56edd9c02a8640808042842e93fcc1aa8f3ecd100fad4",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー也是其中之一哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f2313df5c5084ef02cf59e14d1b2f521dd859ee05738f24acda88bba223f87f",
      "text": "闲话休提，正如制作人所言，我一路上邂逅着亲切的人与出色的人，最终抵达了布达佩斯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a983eb0cdf48ab92b45458c5c16dd86f5f5bbdd7d9d202721aa12bc7e9b7852e",
      "text": "看到那片景象，我就觉得来对了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f26425496131a9c7f44033a639b63c0f787767a5573332b4f8bc5646f15e094",
      "text": "因为宛如从童话故事中跃然而出的美丽水都，\n就那样展现在了我的眼前。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a725e92863d823e461975b436d1da797ab67f98b9847de9f2e4d815c90cdcb5e",
      "text": "令人深切明白了人们为什么会将其比作\n美丽的宝石与花朵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b35b5b71501e9bc05b0e67b83a6705c3a7db17ff6c368f5372045c2956e07b93",
      "text": "我也真想去看一次啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee02781f5a0bbd7b257790ba42ab3d8ce2461d529a5ec5476c28147965df8dfe",
      "text": "是啊。美丽到让人想一直看下去。\n实际上，我当时确实忘了时间吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93547ba202e12b7b3f1d8dfffb7a0e8578da6b8c7f0e6d5ecd4cabca42090968",
      "text": "如果不是被人用日语搭话，\n我大概会一直看下去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3369432b90bfd035cc14391bfa7df1d841e1c19aa6d9da894bd98b26bdae223e",
      "text": "又有了美妙的邂逅吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bca7174b8094fe040e1314728cbab91c2f3689765556dc86c2defa022e400887",
      "text": "答对了。我遇到了一位在匈牙利留学的日本学生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d868e3f6db5c81feb69900a216c61a0eaf7f4195e42c69037687b06a4a14a09b",
      "text": "因为和他年龄相仿，很快便意气相投了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3db83229a2c9afa3e8488d17745a09a19194250025c9c7ac53d4d35d9130bf56",
      "text": "聊到我接下来要找酒店，\n他就顺势邀请我住到了他家里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8313ead5f6f238373d23b97d9a58b5a1c604ac3854ab1be217ab899b3fcfdf4",
      "text": "于是我就在那儿借住了好几天，\n他带着我逛遍了布达佩斯的各个地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3da45ac366cdb82befe2d2cd0764ebb346f3eb76a086195abaf5cbbfe281258",
      "text": "去了只有当地居民才知道的隐藏好去处，\n品尝了传统料理，走过了著名的大桥，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4f75887776cfb584a229b2dd43feaba5cf469ca51760ee7ff9fc68720ce11ea",
      "text": "真的度过了一段非常愉快的时光啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9784f8d0f93180ed4dae614e573f886c821b8a61b780f5ed5e889d9efe9db430",
      "text": "听幸广先生讲故事，\n总觉得有种身临其境的感觉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_e:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4679ac88e622fa2061907452952da47ab16f88bf34c95d75ed0cd2512b0edff9",
      "text": "除了匈牙利之外，您还去过哪里呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70c1d69676beacc551414d1749b222c6c131b5aa409bb68d46fdf5b858508311",
      "text": "丹麦哦。对对，在那里，走在我前面的人\n掉了东西。我捡起来还给了他。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e949184427bc9b45201661453641e5e1398e9cb8d7e74894ffe1ef5c47e6e22",
      "text": "似乎是非常贵重的东西，\n他说为了答谢，想送我一件家具。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e9db131c74a155ed08975ca05aa6a43583c5fa0dba9d3b76fe06b428b9e2cbb",
      "text": "家具吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f831577dae5735f6a424f891ac44b1d39947b4188e3676e3417fe61e76c53ad3",
      "text": "是啊，他是一位家具工匠。不过因为我还在旅途中，\n就改成参观了他的工作室……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5cf2a98e7b352316075e7768bd62cf8eb9668046bb24a3cc8ede0d61db91b5e",
      "text": "哎呀，咲和卷绪发信息过来了。\n好像马上就要到店里了。都到这个时候啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d7517cb825bd1714bee10041e6270b59ff75ff0fa5c7f5ad886b96ab38da598",
      "text": "因为●●●●プロデューサー是个好听众，\n感觉时间过得特别快呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:255f5416a25acc4e2f031665324267f99e960df56f42726a00af240263eb5c92",
      "text": "是幸广先生太擅长讲故事了啦。每一个故事都很有趣，\n正如Cafe Parade的口碑一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cdbaecd04f9903a525f2af22577248f7673861d34285cee19f6b63bac7b7504",
      "text": "如果可以的话，下次请再讲给我听吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_01_1_2_027_01:1_2_027_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37d1e500dd0ba390dfbfe8bac5929407c287fc8b3809378573da4f33fdd30367",
      "text": "当然好啊。不用等下次，试吃会结束后，\n一边喝红茶一边和大家一起听我讲吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
